{
	chapter.0B8102086014824B.title: "Lesser Changes"
	chapter.11B8840F7D7B1D6D.title: "Getting Artsy With It!"
	chapter.14D1AFBC37A219AD.title: "Tools"
	chapter.1522DFBFEAED112C.title: "Farming and You"
	chapter.2035F5EB122445E6.title: "Food and You"
	chapter.314E403E970B06F0.title: "Welcome to BOTB"
	chapter.535A5000E3CF8650.title: "Finding Your Way"
	chapter.5B80C7F1B2211716.title: "Adventurer Fuel"
	chapter.6C88B0989E5DC7A5.title: "Armor"
	chapter.718E92A8988546B8.title: "Enchanting and Repairs"
	chapter.73DE84DC315BEF1A.title: "Vanilla Hostile Mobs"
	chapter_group.00A7F1E0F9B6F6B9.title: "Farming and Nutrition"
	chapter_group.108BB76A56EBEA18.title: "Armor and Tools"
	chapter_group.44C5855AC349FB73.title: "Building Features"
	chapter_group.529B8D3F2DCA00C5.title: "Adventuring"
	chapter_group.6FA754D2051B7826.title: "Introduction"
	chapter_group.716E6A1BAF03E967.title: "Dangers of the World"
	quest.00717F17EBCE860D.quest_desc: [
		"Leather Armor Provides +1 Fall Damage Reduction Per Piece, and Grants a 10.5% Speed boost with the full set."
		""
		"Fall Reduction is on a per Block Basis, a Full set reduces it by a total of 4 blocks of height."
		""
		""
		"This makes it really good for Building and Basic Base Traversal!"
		""
		"You know how you keep falling off your roof mid build and then have to eat food because you lost half your health?"
		""
		"Well this should lessen the blow, or even reduce what you take down to nothing!"
		""
		"You get that and the ability to shmoove! Who doesn't like a lil speed when wandering their unfinished base?"
	]
	quest.00717F17EBCE860D.quest_subtitle: "The Premium Builder's Armor"
	quest.00E5333A8ECDE7C9.quest_desc: [
		"Phantoms have had their spawn conditions changed entirely."
		""
		"Insomnia is no longer a factor, but instead they are designated to spawn in desert, badland, and mountain biomes."
		""
		"So now you can build at night in peace.... granted you aren't building in those biomes."
		""
		"Their Spawn Rates are also at a Fixed 3 Phantoms per Player, so you aren't being absolutely swarmed."
		""
		"They also no longer spawn on top of you, just in the sky in general."
		""
		"Should be more manageable now."
	]
	quest.00E5333A8ECDE7C9.quest_subtitle: "Sleep is Optional Again."
	quest.00E5333A8ECDE7C9.title: "Phantoms"
	quest.01640BF0A21A7BC3.quest_desc: [
		"Lets Cut to the Chase."
		""
		"Mending is Gone."
		""
		"Your Tool no longer Permanently Breaks."
		""
		"The Anvil is now Better (See Enchanting and Repairs Chapter)"
	]
	quest.01640BF0A21A7BC3.quest_subtitle: "No More Losing your Favorite Tool!"
	quest.0353FC08CE1C2D27.quest_desc: ["Raw Meats are no longer Edible. They must be cooked before being consumed."]
	quest.0353FC08CE1C2D27.quest_subtitle: "Have Some Class..."
	quest.03CF5DE552CA3C0F.quest_desc: [
		"Courtesy of Quark, Gold is now innately given Fortune I and Looting I."
		""
		"Enchantments do not stack Fortune and Looting, but instead are replaced if the tool reaches a higher tier of the respective Enchants."
		""
		"Gold Tools have also had their durability GREATLY INCREASED, now being less than Copper, but More than Stone. All while keeping that speed."
		""
		"Now it doesn't break in literally 32 uses... Dont even know why this isn't just how it is."
	]
	quest.03CF5DE552CA3C0F.quest_subtitle: "Feelin Lucky?"
	quest.045642E2B480B7D8.quest_desc: [
		"Copper Armor Provides +1.25 Block Breaking Speed, A Full Set Giving you an Additional +1 Breaking Speed."
		""
		"Copper Armor Yearns for the Mines (or really any block breaking for that matter)."
		""
		"This Set will increase your mining speed by a sizable amount, at the cost of it being a little worse off than iron defensively."
		""
		"While it is primarily for Mining being sped up, It does work against pretty much any block. Turning any tool into essentially a whole tier higher than it other wise would be speed wise."
	]
	quest.045642E2B480B7D8.quest_subtitle: "IT YEARNS!!"
	quest.06BF00DA2BD69ADD.quest_desc: [
		"Nature's Compass is the Explorer's Compass but it locates biomes instead of structures."
		""
		"Good for if you need a certain wood type, or even better you're looking for the Deep Dark to get some Echo Shards (trust me, you'll want them)."
		""
		"Its recipe is unchanged, but might be subject to change based on if I think it needs to be gated. Right now its fine."
	]
	quest.06BF00DA2BD69ADD.quest_subtitle: "Smell the Roses"
	quest.07DAE973F4BDEDE6.quest_desc: [
		"Electrum is an armor set introduced with Oreganized that increases the damage you do based on movement speed."
		""
		"No other tweaks have been made yet, but it will likely receive something in the relative future."
	]
	quest.07DAE973F4BDEDE6.quest_subtitle: "I. Am Speed."
	quest.08E48569DCCA6732.quest_desc: [
		"You know how moving mobs with boats is obnoxious 9 times outta 10?"
		""
		"Yeah, me too. This fixes that."
		""
		"You can craft a wagon that you can attach to a horse to haul mobs, goods, and your friends off with!"
		""
		"To use the wagon, place it down on the ground, then take a TAMED horse. Use a lead on it and then SHIFT + RIGHT CLICK the wagon. You should see your horse snap into place."
		""
		"Then to Drive your wagon, you need to craft a horse whip! Do so and then right click somewhere in the air around the horse(s) to adjust the speed."
		""
		"Steer with your left and right movement keys."
		""
		"There ya go! Better Mob Transport, all while giving horses more of a use!"
	]
	quest.08E48569DCCA6732.quest_subtitle: "Haul em Off!"
	quest.0AB6BB5FFE4C5BDF.quest_desc: [
		"WHILE NOT ALL THE SETS ARE OUT RIGHT YET.."
		""
		"The Idea is that all the previous tiers and their cool effects have a netherite equivalent thats an upgrade from what they currently do"
		""
		"There might even be OTHER UPGRADES your armor can take that get an entirely new effect intended for a different purpose!"
		""
		"All these sidegrades though come with a downside of some kind, So be sure to read what they do first!"
		""
		"The List Below this entry are the current side-grades available"
	]
	quest.0AB6BB5FFE4C5BDF.quest_subtitle: "Your Lower Tier stuff is good now."
	quest.0CE21203399AB629.quest_desc: [
		"Prospector's Rations gives a custom buff called \"Block Buster\", giving you +1 to your Breaking Speed."
		""
		"Helps boost mining along, but also pairs REALLY REALLY WELL with copper armor!"
		""
		"Enjoy your turbo mining speed, goober! GET DAT GOLD!"
	]
	quest.0CE21203399AB629.quest_subtitle: "YEEEEE DAWGY! GET DAT GOLD!"
	quest.12B3C804DB7A3607.quest_desc: [
		"Cooking is a major part of how you feed yourself."
		""
		"You might've noticed that the current vanilla food items just aren't cutting it anymore, Especially since its incredibly hard to maintain your old max health value now."
		""
		"This is because you are eating WRONG."
		""
		"Farmer's Delight (as well as Nether Delight, Miners Delight +, Expanded- you get the point), adds a new cooking process; as well as a ton of fresh new meals to try!"
		""
		"Most of them just give you some nutrition and thats it (mostly because I need to go through them all and change them ;) ), but you might"
		"notice a handful of them actually grant you neat nuanced buffs to help you on your journey!"
		""
		"This Chapter will not only go over kitchen methods, but will also go over what special foods are currently in this modpack that grant usefull buffs."
	]
	quest.12B3C804DB7A3607.quest_subtitle: "It's better than Fast Food."
	quest.131E9C52DE971545.quest_desc: [
		"Maybe you don't need a map or a compass? Maybe you need signs so you don't get lost while spelunking?"
		""
		"Chalk is for you! You can draw arrows that face specific directions so you can tell yourself where you came from!"
		""
		"Maybe even use it as a creative way to make a tour guide line for your world?"
	]
	quest.131E9C52DE971545.quest_subtitle: "Cute way to not get lost!"
	quest.13A5944ACE138BF8.quest_desc: [
		"Rotten Flesh has a major utility, allowing you to clean out your stomach of all food currently in it; as well as any buffs/debuffs currently attached to you."
		""
		"Its really good for if you wanna immediately regain the buff on a food, or alternatively swapping food out for different buffs."
	]
	quest.13A5944ACE138BF8.quest_subtitle: "An Unhealthy Weightloss Program"
	quest.15D4A2422C18EBC7.quest_desc: [
		"Inside of Dungeons are these Ancient Books from Quark, which let your tools exceed the usual enchant cap."
		""
		"This is the Only Way you can go past usual limits, which makes it worth diving into dungeons for more of that sweet sweet power."
	]
	quest.15D4A2422C18EBC7.quest_subtitle: "Wait we get more power?"
	quest.15E30564EEB5EFDF.quest_desc: [
		"Skytrout Kebab (made of Elytrout, yes I goofedup dont @ me; Its not worth fixing) is a food that grants another custom buff I made called \"Endlightened.\""
		""
		"This Buff gives you reduced Gravity a greatly increased jump height, and borderline immunity to fall damage (about 50 blocks worth)."
		""
		"Really great at End Exploration, adds an extra movement option, great for elytra takeoffs, and great for spelunking recklessly in big caves."
	]
	quest.15E30564EEB5EFDF.quest_subtitle: "Goin UP!"
	quest.172BE79E2FE60747.quest_desc: [
		"Nutrition is now Handled with Spice of Life Valheim."
		""
		"Your Food no longer needs to be constantly consumed, but instead the food you consume gives you a boost in stats for the alotted time."
		""
		"When the time runs out, your stats reduce back down to what they would be without that buff."
		""
		"Food's duration ranges anywhere from 5 minutes for something like a raw potato, to about an hour."
		""
		"You can finally play the game where half the time isn't spent scarfing down 64 baked potatoes."
		""
		"Speaking of which... you can no longer eat the same meal back to back. It must be 3 sepparate food items."
		""
		"Mix and match as needed!"
	]
	quest.172BE79E2FE60747.quest_subtitle: "No Longer Annoying!"
	quest.1813D118FDB58BFE.quest_desc: [
		"Sawmill is effectively a Stonecutter for Wood."
		""
		"It lets you turn wood into other possible types, tinker around with it a bit!"
	]
	quest.1813D118FDB58BFE.quest_subtitle: "Stonecutter's Cousin"
	quest.1AA2356AFD0A50E5.quest_desc: [
		"Quark does a lot, and I mean a LOT to the game. So much so I'd advise that if you want all the details, then its the one time I'll say use their site."
		""
		"The Cliff Notes of things I deemed important enough:"
		""
		"- You can place blocks under the one you're standing on."
		""
		"- Chains connected to blocks keeps them attached when pushed by pistons."
		""
		"- Iron Rod to break blocks using pistons (its end game, dont get too excited now)."
		""
		"- Chests can be pushed with Pistons."
		""
		""
		"However I turned off Pickarangs and their Backpacks. You don't need the Pickarang and we have a different Backpack Mod."
	]
	quest.1AA2356AFD0A50E5.quest_subtitle: "Title."
	quest.1B96937EAF8FD68C.quest_desc: [
		"Reverbium is an armor type made using an Upgrade Template, a copper armor piece, and a Reverbium Ingot."
		""
		"You craft Reverbium Ingots using Copper Ingots and Sculk Blocks the same way you would netherite (Yes this does mean you need silk touch)."
		""
		"This Armor Set gives you a HUGE BOOST in mining speed, a Full set capable of making an efficiency 5 netherite pick treat stone like netherrack!"
		""
		"The Downside though is that it has less defense than diamond, and the digging speed copper once had is now specifically your pickaxe mining speed."
		""
		"So you trade up a universal mining speed boost with a specialized one thats significantly stronger."
	]
	quest.1B96937EAF8FD68C.quest_subtitle: "Copper but Specialized and Stronger!"
	quest.22F199EE6438849D.quest_desc: [
		"Iron Armor Gives you a 15% increase to Projectile Resistance, With the Full Set of Iron Giving you a Constant Strength Buff!"
		""
		"Makes it Really Good as a more nuanced defensive armor slot option."
		""
		"In an area with a lot of Skeletons? Iron."
		""
		"Don't like the ranged damage you're receiving from a mob I might've added and forgot about? Iron."
		""
		"In general this is really solid to greatly reduce ranged damage taken."
		""
		""
		""
		"The Iron Set can be Mixed up with Chainmail to get the set Bonus!"
		""
		"So you can swap around Iron and Chainmail as you please to still keep your strength buff."
	]
	quest.22F199EE6438849D.quest_subtitle: "Solid Defense Option With a Kick!"
	quest.22F199EE6438849D.title: "Iron"
	quest.289446D758AF539B.quest_desc: [
		"Compost is a new Craftable Block brought by Farmer's Delight that gives you the ability to gain \"Rich Soil\"."
		""
		"It goes through 8 stages of \"Decomposition\", once done resulting in rich soil."
		""
		"When it turns into rich soil, you can use a hoe on it and plant crops on top of it."
		""
		"Rich Soil increases crop Growth rate by 20%"
		""
		"There's Also Leteous Compost thanks to Nether's Delight, and it too has a processing time to gain \"Resurgent Soil\""
		""
		"However, admittedly theres no wiki page on it that I saw and I have no idea if the growth speed boost is the same or better than Rich Soil, let alone if it gives a growth boost at all."
		""
		"I'll let you figure that one out ;)"
	]
	quest.289446D758AF539B.quest_subtitle: "Better Soil for your Trouble!"
	quest.28ACE9BC405A0F69.quest_desc: [
		"Its Exactly How it is in Vanilla except its Set Bonus Increases your Armor Toughness by 2."
		""
		"I wanted an armor type to serve as a sort of Baseline for future End Game Side Grades, Felt Diamond would be a good Candidate."
		""
		"It makes for a solid slot filler should you need more defense in a lower tier while reaping their stat bonus benefits."
		""
		"Trusty Diamond Armor, Always Reliable."
	]
	quest.28ACE9BC405A0F69.quest_subtitle: "Ol' Faithful"
	quest.2A7E846EAFC7FA5A.quest_desc: [
		"Netherite Upgrade Templates now have a dedicated crafting recipe using Netherite Scrap, Gold Ingots, Blaze Rods, and a Diamond."
		""
		"Now theres a consistent way to get Netherite Upgrade Templates, however you may also notice duplication recipes are gone."
		""
		"This means you have to actually legitimately craft them now."
		""
		"The recipe SHOULD feel reasonable, but also still make finding one in a bastion feel just as rewarding!"
	]
	quest.2A7E846EAFC7FA5A.quest_subtitle: "Easier Access, but no more duping."
	quest.2E17793EF44CDB4E.quest_desc: [
		"Sheep no longer drop wool when killed, you must use shears."
		""
		"In light of this however, Insomnia has been removed as a mechanic."
		""
		"Skipping night time isn't something you should get for free, its an earned right."
	]
	quest.2E17793EF44CDB4E.quest_subtitle: "Hope you don't need to sleep anytime soon..."
	quest.2E91E4564633F710.quest_desc: [
		"Using Sodium's Dynamic Lights Addon, Light Sources now emit light while in your hand or wherever else it happens to be compatible."
		""
		"If you for whatever reason didn't have this on by default like it should be, its found in your video settings!"
	]
	quest.2E91E4564633F710.quest_subtitle: "How it Should Be."
	quest.3560663CE79872A2.quest_desc: ["Wool can now be deconstructed into string."]
	quest.3560663CE79872A2.quest_subtitle: "It only made sense."
	quest.395B0EB84909D981.quest_desc: [
		"Added Vertical Slabs through Architect's Palette and Quark."
		""
		"All of the types of vert slabs should have recipes but if they don't, yell at me in discord."
	]
	quest.395B0EB84909D981.quest_subtitle: "Self Explanatory"
	quest.3A0EF940FB5E6504.quest_desc: [
		"People often add new biomes but then don't actually tweak their custom logic to account for new biomes."
		""
		""
		"So I did. The custom phantom rules does actually acknowledge the biomes in RU."
		""
		"So enjoy the many wood types and blocks the mod provides while not having your experience absolutely curb stomped!"
	]
	quest.3A0EF940FB5E6504.quest_subtitle: "All new biomes, tweaked to not break things"
	quest.3AA81D68DB11DB86.quest_desc: [
		"Chainmail is very similar to Iron except instead of projectile resistance, it has melee resistance. Providing Strength as a Set Bonus."
		""
		"Chainmail is now Craftable using Chains and Iron Ingots (consult JEI for patterning)."
		""
		"You can mix and match Chainmail with Iron to get their Set Bonus, allowing you to fine tune to your combat needs."
	]
	quest.3AA81D68DB11DB86.quest_subtitle: "Iron But More Personal."
	quest.3C4B848DDF51302A.quest_desc: ["Cows now guaranteed drop 1 Leather bare minimum when killed."]
	quest.3C4B848DDF51302A.quest_subtitle: "Skinless No More!"
	quest.4090DA1A73F7A94F.quest_desc: [
		"Joy of Painting (Neo) is a port of a mod that gives you the ability to make your own custom paintings."
		""
		"Utilizing Dyes you put in your Palette, You can paint a variety of paintings yourself and make the world look as pretty as you wish it to!"
		""
		"Go wild!"
	]
	quest.4090DA1A73F7A94F.quest_subtitle: "How about some happy lil' trees?"
	quest.42988D60FDD9B308.quest_desc: ["Reverbium Upgrade Templates are found in the Ancient City, and craftable using Sculk Blocks, Copper Ingots, Breeze Rods, and a Diamond."]
	quest.42988D60FDD9B308.quest_subtitle: "You Afraid of the Dark?"
	quest.42988D60FDD9B308.title: "Reverbium Upgrade Template"
	quest.470C1F1F670D1ABC.quest_desc: [
		"The plan is the Contributors will get something special inside this modpack down the road, but for now I figured having this was atleast something until that point!"
		""
		"Special Thanks to the Following Contributors!"
		""
		"Bodhismith13 - Helped Fix the bug with Phantoms Causing TPS Issues!"
		""
		"Emma - Moderator for Modpack Dev Knowledgebase - Consistently provided tips and pointers to find information!"
		""
		"Deepa Cat - Helped with understanding KubeJS for 1.21.1 (Fun fact, this version has little to no documentation)"
		""
		"Rimevel - Helped with understanding KubeJS for 1.21.1"
		""
		"Bluversal - Assisted in getting the Main Menu working properly"
		""
		"Nekomaster - Assisted with telling me what structures were hard coded in the game, and how to work around it."
		""
		"Zeta - Made the Anti-Armor Breaking System!"
		""
		"Theluckyguynl - Made new textures for the hammers and excavators!"
		""
		"Acenthus - Provided the data pack to make the Felling Enchantment, as well as a translation for it!"
		""
		"HaxTheCharizard - Provided the initial concept for Reverbium! (Not the armor textures, but the inventory icons. I take full credit for the vomit texture on your reverbium <3 )"
		""
		"This Modpack wouldn't have been possible without you!"
	]
	quest.470C1F1F670D1ABC.quest_subtitle: "This wouldn't be possible without you!"
	quest.470C1F1F670D1ABC.title: "THANK YOU CONTRIBUTORS!"
	quest.48D63DE2A9A69D4C.quest_desc: [
		"Stoves are the major staple of cooking in Farmer's Delight."
		""
		"You craft yourself some pots and pans, slap it on top of the stove, and then light the stove with a magma charge or flint and steel!"
		""
		"After which you can begin cooking food, utilizing JEI to search for food recipes."
		""
		"Once you start cooking on this, you're never gonna want to use vanilla methods again, (though an emergency furnace might come in handy should you need more food on the go)."
		""
		"Here's a fun tip: You can light a stove with a magma block under it instead!"
	]
	quest.48D63DE2A9A69D4C.quest_subtitle: "No More Metal in your Food."
	quest.4C4D3DA3464670BA.quest_desc: [
		"Stuffed Puff is a Custom Item made by yours truly~"
		""
		"Its made with a simple cooking process that requires Pufferfish, Mushrooms, Bread, Salt, and Peppers."
		""
		"This Food gives you 15 minutes of Water Breathing, making it exceptional not just at underwater exploration but for building underwater bases without having to scour the earth for a conduit."
		""
		"Conduits are still useful though given they give infinite water breathing, but ay! This will do!"
	]
	quest.4C4D3DA3464670BA.quest_subtitle: "This feels wrong... still tastes good though!"
	quest.4EF77F149E0E71FE.quest_desc: [
		"A very simple meal."
		""
		"It gives you a minute and a half of the Comfort buff."
		""
		"Also lasts a REEEEEEEEALLY long time so its just a good slot filler should you need it."
	]
	quest.4EF77F149E0E71FE.quest_subtitle: "A Classic"
	quest.4F5241DE108C0261.quest_desc: [
		"This Dish gives you 15 straight minutes of increased Fishing Speed."
		""
		"Really good for mass stockpiling fish."
	]
	quest.4F5241DE108C0261.quest_subtitle: "Go Fish."
	quest.4FAC0F3D65926C32.quest_desc: [
		"Ore clusters now have a chance to show up as massive ore clusters!"
		""
		"There's also Boulders underground that have a chance to be filled with shiny rocks too!"
	]
	quest.4FAC0F3D65926C32.quest_subtitle: "Hitting the Jackpot!"
	quest.4FAC0F3D65926C32.title: "Large Ore Deposits and Boulders!"
	quest.50FD9E24B1BD87F3.quest_desc: [
		"This is the real meat and potatoes of what I'm doing with the caves outside of dungeons."
		""
		"I wanna make exploring underground far more rewarding than exploring the surface."
		""
		"You'll find all sorts of new blocks, ores, and creatures deep in the earth."
		""
		"Resources you once thought useless? (Mostly) Useful now."
		""
		"Enjoy Spelunking!"
	]
	quest.50FD9E24B1BD87F3.quest_subtitle: "More Exploration For Your Cave"
	quest.51136DC834FFBEFD.quest_desc: [
		"You know how I said I take issue with not being able to consistently locate a structure thats needed to play more of the game?"
		""
		""
		"This mod solves that problem."
		""
		"This mod will direct you straight to a structure of your choice."
		""
		"It's recipe was reworked though, you'll need some interesting new resources; Notably an Eye of Ender."
	]
	quest.51136DC834FFBEFD.quest_subtitle: "No more Aimless Wandering"
	quest.52FC782F3F75826A.quest_desc: [
		"Gold Armor Provides 20% Magic Resistance Per Piece, and Gains Innate Fortune as a Set Bonus."
		""
		"Magic Resistance? Whats That?"
		""
		"Currently in Minecraft there is a damage type that is exclusively affected by Protection, and Thats Magic."
		""
		"Magic is pretty Niche (at least as of the current version of this modpack... hint hint), but basically Evokers, Potion Damage, Guardian Beams..."
		""
		""
		"Bottom line, it's a sizable list of things that ignore your armor... About time we had something that solved that."
		""
		"This Armor Should be Pretty Serviceable against these threats, and might even be useful for the Woodland Mansion as a good armor set to run!"
		""
		"Fortune is just a community voted place holder until I can give it a more special set bonus. Dont hate me. "
	]
	quest.52FC782F3F75826A.quest_subtitle: "Magically Imbued"
	quest.573DD99C1FE5DF87.quest_desc: [
		"Armor in Minecraft Always sorta bothered me."
		""
		""
		"Netherite ruins any need for the lower tiers, and a pure Vertical climb actually causes people to hard focus one set of armor instead of appreciating the lower tiers."
		""
		"We don't have reasons to keep materials at lower tiers unless a recipe requires it."
		""
		"and We have no Horizontal Progression Options that allow us to change our Approach."
		""
		"I want the weaker armor pieces to have a reason to exist."
		""
		"The Following Quests Detail how each Armor has been Changed with both stat boosts and set bonuses as well as new sidegrades available at the end game. I think you'll find theres some neat new ideas here. Might even be worth using them, despite you having Netherite now? If not do let me know."
		""
		""
		"UNLESS STATED OTHERWISE, THESE EFFECTS STACK WITH ENCHANTMENTS!!!"
	]
	quest.573DD99C1FE5DF87.quest_subtitle: "Making Verticality More Horizontal."
	quest.5C3BDE6441D1932E.quest_desc: [
		"Anvils have been reworked as your Main Way to Repair your tools."
		""
		"Anvils no longer have a \"too expensive\" property, and you will be able to repair as much as you damn well please."
		""
		"This is Because not only do your tools no longer permanently break, but Mending has been removed from the game."
		""
		"Bringing back necessity for resources in the resource collection game!"
		""
		"You can Repair your Anvil by Right Clicking on it with an Ingot, keep in mind this will change its rotation based on how you're facing."
	]
	quest.5C3BDE6441D1932E.quest_subtitle: "NOW ACTUALLY GOOD!"
	quest.5C6B7EA8BF8DD950.quest_desc: [
		"A Modpack That Aims to Refocus Minecraft's Design back to where it all was built from... Mining, Crafting, and Building!"
		""
		"This Book is &4NOT&r a quest book. There's no rewards here, instead its actually meant to serve as a guide book to all the changes this modpack makes! I've always been against the idea of being forced to wiki dive for all of your information, so this book is to serve as a remedy to that problem."
		""
		"I hope this Guide book will serve you well and give you all the information necessary, if it doesn't; Join the discord and call me stinky, followed by the reason why I'm stinky."
		""
		"I may be the Modpack's Creator, but this Modpack is also created through the help of players like &eYOU&r!"
		""
		"Afterall, Minecraft has always been a game about community above all else!"
		""
		"Explore the Tabs as you want or need to, and I do hope you enjoy your time at &5THE BOTTOM OF THE BARREL&r"
	]
	quest.5C6B7EA8BF8DD950.quest_subtitle: "&5Welcome to the Bottom of The Barrel!&r"
	quest.61BF94239D5F1457.quest_desc: [
		"Lanterns can be attached to your Hip by Pressing B, and unattached by pressing it again."
		""
		"Why no belt slot? Because the mod didn't work lol, but honestly this is better."
	]
	quest.61BF94239D5F1457.quest_subtitle: "Hold a Lantern, Press \"B\""
	quest.6204576F4AE60170.quest_desc: [
		"Elytras are now able to be equipped to the back slot!"
		""
		"Obviously you'll need to decide whether you want a backpack or an elytra, but I have a sneaking suspicion as to what you'll chose."
	]
	quest.6204576F4AE60170.quest_subtitle: "Wear Armor and Elytras!"
	quest.62B7BA87E307BB40.quest_desc: [
		"Farming is gonna be your best friend in this modpack, as you'll find that the simpler vanilla meals are no longer nearly as good as they once were."
		""
		"Not only because the more complicated meals last longer and give more health and buffs, but because the vanilla foods in general were knocked down a few pegs to incentivize you making meals to start with."
		""
		"Getting crops goin, animal farms setup, and a proper kitchen is going to be paramount to your survival from here on out."
		""
		"In this particular chapter we will be discussing the new crops and the changes done to mob drops."
	]
	quest.62B7BA87E307BB40.quest_subtitle: "Understand the Importance of Farming"
	quest.64D9879BD0AB432E.quest_desc: [
		"Netherite Armor gives you Increased Knockback Resistance, With its Set Bonus Making you Immune to Fire Damage."
		""
		"This is Where my Design might be put into question but lemme explain."
		""
		"While there aren't any side grades for it CURRENTLY.... The Idea is that most Sidegrades will be Around this Level of Strength."
		""
		"So to Make Room for this when I add new Armor Sets, this is the point of the armor...."
		""
		"Netherite is the Perfect Armor for Nether Traversal."
		""
		"Increased Knockback Resistance means you wont have ghasts and hoglins knocking you from here to Timbuktu."
		""
		"Fire Immunity means the Lava Lakes are no longer a problem, outside of obviously being slower to traverse through."
		""
		"Also Fire Immunity means working with lava for builds or diving into lava for diamonds is a little less of an occupational hazard."
		""
		"Eventually this armor will receive a downside upon being worn, but for now I'm leaving it as just general bonuses before I worry about that."
	]
	quest.64D9879BD0AB432E.quest_subtitle: "Its Bigger and Better!"
	quest.67FC02B01E0750B4.quest_desc: [
		"Bounty boards can be found on some surface structures, and often give you some tasks that net you a fine reward if you complete them!"
		""
		"I may not be adding much to the surface world, but I wanted to give yall surface dwellers a lil somethin somethin ;)"
	]
	quest.67FC02B01E0750B4.quest_subtitle: "Quests!.... Kinda."
	quest.68E1F8DA2F703342.quest_desc: [
		"The Atlas is a way for you to map the world yourself, leaving lil markers to remind you where cool stuff is at."
		""
		"It functions much like a regular map but it scrolls and shows land formations in an aesthetically pleasing way."
	]
	quest.68E1F8DA2F703342.quest_subtitle: "Mapping but not clogging your UI"
	quest.6AFEEACCCC06842D.quest_desc: [
		"Sophisticated Backpacks have been Added, which give you access to effectively a second inventory."
		""
		"Why Sophisticated Backpacks? I dunno dude, I like the upgrades... speaking of which."
		""
		"The Stack and Inception upgrades have been Disabled for obvious reasons, and the Inventory of them all have been greatly reduced to feel more reasonable."
	]
	quest.6AFEEACCCC06842D.quest_subtitle: "Don't Worry, I rebalanced it."
	quest.6BC91C7839148DC4.quest_desc: [
		"Hammers and Excavators Mine Rocks and Soil in a 3x3 Radius, and are available in all tiers but Copper (as copper is a modded feature)."
		""
		"Hammers and Excavators cannot receive the Fortune or Vein Mining Enchantments, if I allowed that theyd just be better than their counterparts."
		""
		"Hammers are meant for Large Precision Terraforming."
		""
		"It always Bothered Me that our options for terraforming were either one block at a time, or the Nuclear option."
		""
		"We needed a tool for more precise large scale destruction."
		""
		"Enjoy having less cramped strip mines, and a swifter ability to level mountains."
	]
	quest.6BC91C7839148DC4.quest_subtitle: "About Damn Time."
	quest.6BC91C7839148DC4.title: "Hammers and Excavators"
	quest.6E6AC5435D5003EC.quest_desc: [
		"This Food gives one of the few custom buffs I've added called \"Burning Rage\""
		""
		"This Buff gives you a 30% reduction on fire burn time, and a flat 2 Damage Boost."
		""
		"Great for Nether Survivability, or if you just want that big boost in damage!"
	]
	quest.6E6AC5435D5003EC.quest_subtitle: "BEEFCAKE!"
	quest.6EC2E2131BC96289.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to the Mod called \"Immersive Enchantments\"; Enchantment Gambling is a thing of the past!"
		""
		"ALL ENCHANTMENTS ARE NOW ABLE TO BE GAINED THROUGH USING RESOURCES AND LEVELS!"
		""
		"This means so long as you have the resources and levels, you can add the Enchantment of choice!"
		""
		"You also innately know all levels and enchantments available, Which means Bookshelves are no longer required."
		""
		"Returning Bookshelves into a Cosmetic Block. (Maybe sometime I'll find a use for them again, but for now they can stay in timeout)"
	]
	quest.6EC2E2131BC96289.quest_subtitle: "No Longer Random!"
	quest.70A25BCE7403C177.quest_desc: ["Using Geophillic, All Current Biomes have been given a face lift."]
	quest.70A25BCE7403C177.quest_subtitle: "Pretty much how it sounds"
	quest.713A559F16D32DFE.quest_desc: [
		"THIS MODPACK IS IN AN ALPHA STATE!!!!"
		""
		"THINGS WILL BREAK, DETAILS MIGHT NOT BE COVERED IN THIS QUEST BOOK, AND UPDATES MAY HAVE ISSUES!!!"
		""
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"So if you wanna save your world for one reason or another before an update, or want a backup to fall on should the new update break things...."
		""
		""
		""
		""
		"BACK UP YOUR SAVES BEFORE EVERY UPDATE!!!!"
		""
		"&4You've been Warned....&r"
	]
	quest.713A559F16D32DFE.quest_subtitle: "&4IT IS INCREDIBLY IMPORTANT THAT YOU READ THIS&r"
	quest.75173175C95F72C2.quest_desc: [
		"Farmer's Delight and the Delight Addons add all sorts of new crops that are required for certain food recipes, most if not all of which are just found out in the wild."
		""
		"Farming them is going to be pretty important for making any meal worth consuming."
		""
		"Consult JEI for more information!"
	]
	quest.75173175C95F72C2.quest_subtitle: "Well Balanced Diets"
	quest.7C40EA4859072979.quest_desc: [
		"Courtesy of Chisels and Bits, You can now Edit Blocks on a micro adjustment scale."
		""
		"Literally tap away one pixel at a time to get all the details for your base perfectly as you want it."
		""
		"(If this mod ends up causing performance problems, Its getting atomized. For now it stays, enjoy! :) )"
	]
